{
  "info": {
    "name": "Tally API (staging)",
    "description": "Tally's backend: businesses and inventory, onboarding from Qore Catalog templates, and camera recognition (shelf scans, stock-take, identify one product). All routes are under `/api`.\n\n**Auth**: a Supabase access token (shared Qorelly project) sent as `Authorization: Bearer`. Run *Auth → Sign in* first: it stores `accessToken` for every request. Use a **test account**. Never put real credentials in a shared copy of this collection (fill `email` / `password` in your local Postman only, as secret variables).\n\n**Setup**: set `baseUrl` (staging `https://tally-api.qorecatalogue.com`, local `http://localhost:4100`), `supabaseUrl`, `supabaseAnonKey` (the project's public anon/publishable key), `email`, `password`.\n\n**Flow**: Sign in → Catalog: verticals → Businesses: create (saves `businessId`) → Catalog: templates → Businesses: starter inventory → Vision: shelf scan (attach a photo) → Vision: confirm scan. Requests save the ids they create (`businessId`, `scanId`, `runId`, `itemId`, `identifyReading`) for the next steps.\n\nCatalogue data comes from Qore Catalog (prices indicative, whole Naira). Tally never exposes its Qore Catalog key.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:4100"
    },
    {
      "key": "supabaseUrl",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "supabaseAnonKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "businessId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "itemId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "scanId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "runId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "qid",
      "value": "QC-D4MP-3XTA-Y"
    },
    {
      "key": "identifyReading",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sign in (Supabase, test account)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "apikey",
                "value": "{{supabaseAnonKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password",
              "host": [
                "{{supabaseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "v1",
                "token"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "password",
                  "description": ""
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Signs in with email + password against the shared Supabase project and stores the access token in `accessToken`. Tokens expire (about 1 hour): run this again on 401.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json(); if (b.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', b.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public liveness probe; also reports whether Qore Catalog is reachable.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Catalog (via Qore Catalog)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Verticals and sub-types",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/verticals",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "catalog",
                "verticals"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public (needed before signup). Business types and sub-types; codes are what `subtypeCode` takes. Cached 10 min.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Sub-type templates",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/subtypes/supermarket/templates?suggestions=2",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "catalog",
                "subtypes",
                "supermarket",
                "templates"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "suggestions",
                  "value": "2",
                  "description": "0-5 product suggestions per item"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Starter template items for a sub-type. `suggestions` (0-5) adds catalogue products per item, with indicative prices. Cached 10 min."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Search products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products?q=peak milk&limit=5",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "catalog",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "peak milk",
                  "description": "2-200 chars"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "5",
                  "description": "1-100"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Search the catalogue (semantic + typo-tolerant)."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json(); const v = b.items && b.items[0] && b.items[0].qid; if (v) pm.collectionVariables.set('qid', typeof v === 'string' ? v : JSON.stringify(v));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get product",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/catalog/products/{{qid}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "catalog",
                "products",
                "{{qid}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "One product with indicative price and variants. A merged product returns { qid, status: 'merged', mergedInto }."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Businesses & inventory",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create business",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/businesses",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "businesses"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Creates a business; you become its owner. `subtypeCode` must exist in Qore Catalog (see Verticals). Saves `businessId`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test Supermarket (Postman)\",\n  \"subtypeCode\": \"supermarket\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201/200', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json(); const v = b.id || (b.business && b.business.id); if (v) pm.collectionVariables.set('businessId', typeof v === 'string' ? v : JSON.stringify(v));"
                ]
